#: keyresolver.cpp:593
msgid ""
"One or more of your configured OpenPGP encryption keys or S/MIME "
"certificates is not usable for encryption. Please reconfigure your "
"encryption keys and certificates for this identity in the identity "
"configuration dialog.\n"
"If you choose to continue, and the keys are needed later on, you will be "
"prompted to specify the keys to use."
msgstr ""
"Едне или повеќе од вашите конфигурирани OpenPGP-клучеви за криптирање или S/"
"MIME-сертификати не е употреблив за криптирање. Реконфигурирајте ги вашите "
"клучеви за криптирање и сертификати за овој идентитет во дијалогот за "
"конфигурација на идентитет.\n"
"Ако изберете да продолжите и ако клучевите се потребни подоцна, ќе бидете "
"прашан да ги наведете клучевите што ќе се користат."

#: keyresolver.cpp:601 keyresolver.cpp:914 keyresolver.cpp:941
msgid "Unusable Encryption Keys"
msgstr "Неупотребливи клучеви за криптирање"

#: keyresolver.cpp:637
msgid ""
"One or more of your configured OpenPGP signing keys or S/MIME signing "
"certificates is not usable for signing. Please reconfigure your signing keys "
"and certificates for this identity in the identity configuration dialog.\n"
"If you choose to continue, and the keys are needed later on, you will be "
"prompted to specify the keys to use."
msgstr ""
"Едне или повеќе од вашите конфигурирани OpenPGP-клучеви за потпишување или S/"
"MIME-сертификати за потпишување не е употреблив за потпишување. "
"Реконфигурирајте ги вашите клучеви за потпишување и сертификати за овој "
"идентитет во дијалогот за конфигурација на идентитет.\n"
"Ако изберете да продолжите и ако клучевите се потребни подоцна, ќе бидете "
"прашан да ги наведете клучевите што ќе се користат."

#: keyresolver.cpp:645 keyresolver.cpp:968 keyresolver.cpp:985
msgid "Unusable Signing Keys"
msgstr "Неупотребливи клучеви за потпишување"

#: keyresolver.cpp:905
msgid ""
"Examination of recipient's encryption preferences yielded that the message "
"should be encrypted using OpenPGP, at least for some recipients;\n"
"however, you have not configured valid trusted OpenPGP encryption keys for "
"this identity.\n"
"You may continue without encrypting to yourself, but be aware that you will "
"not be able to read your own messages if you do so."
msgstr ""

#: keyresolver.cpp:932
msgid ""
"Examination of recipient's encryption preferences yielded that the message "
"should be encrypted using S/MIME, at least for some recipients;\n"
"however, you have not configured valid S/MIME encryption certificates for "
"this identity.\n"
"You may continue without encrypting to yourself, but be aware that you will "
"not be able to read your own messages if you do so."
msgstr ""

#: keyresolver.cpp:962
msgid ""
"Examination of recipient's signing preferences yielded that the message "
"should be signed using OpenPGP, at least for some recipients;\n"
"however, you have not configured valid OpenPGP signing certificates for this "
"identity."
msgstr ""

#: keyresolver.cpp:969
msgid "Do Not OpenPGP-Sign"
msgstr "Не потпишувај со OpenPGP"

#: keyresolver.cpp:979
msgid ""
"Examination of recipient's signing preferences yielded that the message "
"should be signed using S/MIME, at least for some recipients;\n"
"however, you have not configured valid S/MIME signing certificates for this "
"identity."
msgstr ""

#: keyresolver.cpp:986
msgid "Do Not S/MIME-Sign"
msgstr "Не потпишувај со S/MIME"

#: keyresolver.cpp:1043
msgid ""
"Examination of recipient's signing preferences showed no common type of "
"signature matching your available signing keys.\n"
"Send message without signing?"
msgstr ""

#: keyresolver.cpp:1047
msgid "No signing possible"
msgstr "Потпишувањето не е возможно"

#: keyresolver.cpp:1202
msgid ""
"You did not select an encryption key for yourself (encrypt to self). You "
"will not be able to decrypt your own message if you encrypt it."
msgstr ""
"Не избравте клуч за криптирање на вас самиот (encrypt to self). Нема да "
"можете да ја декриптирате вашата сопствена порака ако ја криптирате."

#: keyresolver.cpp:1206 keyresolver.cpp:1230 keyresolver.cpp:1244
